{"3590660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Metits Magic 3: The Revenge Of Luli", "steam_appid": 3590660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3599590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Darseki High School. You’re not supposed to be here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Metits Magic 3: The Revenge of Luli</i>, you step into the dark, twisted corridors of a once-familiar school, now haunted by terrifying secrets. This survival horror adventure will push your mind, reflexes, and courage to their limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧬 <strong>Uncover the Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious disappearance, you wake up inside the Alon Building with one goal: find out what really happened to the Sacred Protein. But you’re not alone.<br>The halls echo with the footsteps of <strong>Big Marina</strong>, the school's terrifying principal, now patrolling the corridors with a mind of her own. Stay low. Move fast. Don’t let her see you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 <strong>Face the Faculty from Hell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teachers you once trusted are now monsters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jaffa Mirror</strong>: A corrupted language teacher stalking you through Class Y1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gariela &amp; Rachel</strong>: Twin forces of biblical horror—Gariela uses scripture to summon her sister from beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costa</strong>: The electronics teacher who controls both fire and lightning in an unforgettable boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luli</strong>: He was just a quiet kid. Now, he’s your worst nightmare. His rage is the final obstacle between you and the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metits Magic 3: The Revenge of Luli</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some memories don’t stay buried. Are you ready to face them?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Darseki High School. You’re not supposed to be here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Metits Magic 3: The Revenge of Luli</i>, you step into the dark, twisted corridors of a once-familiar school, now haunted by terrifying secrets. This survival horror adventure will push your mind, reflexes, and courage to their limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧬 <strong>Uncover the Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious disappearance, you wake up inside the Alon Building with one goal: find out what really happened to the Sacred Protein. But you’re not alone.<br>The halls echo with the footsteps of <strong>Big Marina</strong>, the school's terrifying principal, now patrolling the corridors with a mind of her own. Stay low. Move fast. Don’t let her see you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 <strong>Face the Faculty from Hell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The teachers you once trusted are now monsters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jaffa Mirror</strong>: A corrupted language teacher stalking you through Class Y1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gariela &amp; Rachel</strong>: Twin forces of biblical horror—Gariela uses scripture to summon her sister from beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costa</strong>: The electronics teacher who controls both fire and lightning in an unforgettable boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luli</strong>: He was just a quiet kid. Now, he’s your worst nightmare. His rage is the final obstacle between you and the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metits Magic 3: The Revenge of Luli</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some memories don’t stay buried. Are you ready to face them?</i></p>", "short_description": "Trapped in a High School, you must uncove